    "body": "<h2 id=\"h_01JMW5W2421GCKCZQ0NQJ3P8SG\">You will learn</h2>\n<p>Learn how to use countdown timers to add a sense of urgency to your sign-up forms. Countdown timers work particularly well for flash sales, special promotions, or holiday messaging.</p>\n<h2 id=\"h_01JMW5W2421YZS94SJC8DZQB16\">Add a timer to a sign-up form</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>Navigate to <strong>Sign-up forms</strong> in Klaviyo.</li>\n<li>Open an existing form, or click <strong>Create New Sign-up Form</strong>.</li>\n<li>Click <strong>Add Blocks</strong> in the form editor.</li>\n<li>Drag a <strong>Countdown timer</strong> block into your form.<br>\n\n<img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/28720773122331\" alt=\"Countdown timer block\" width=\"335\" height=\"276\">\n</li>\n<li>Adjust the timer settings as desired. </li>\n<li>Click <strong>Publish</strong> to publish your edits and set the form live. </li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"h_01JMW5W242K7VD1XYET88GNB0K\">Adjust countdown timer settings </h2>\n<p>When creating a countdown timer, you can choose between a <strong>Fixed</strong> and <strong>Variable</strong> date type. </p>\n<ul>\n<li>A <strong>Fixed</strong> date countdown timer counts down to a specific date or time. For example, if you have a VIP sale that begins at midnight on a certain date, or a limited time offer with a set end date, use the fixed date setting.</li>\n<li>A <strong>Variable</strong> date countdown timer begins counting down when the form launches, and resets with every new page load. If you set a variable timer to 1 hour, every form viewer will see a countdown timer beginning at 1 hour, regardless of when they visit your site. </li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"h_01JMW5W242NKM1VZ6NXCR5R4ZB\">Fixed date countdowns</h3>\n<p>Choose the exact date and time when the countdown timer should end. You can select a date up to 100 days in the future. </p>\n<p class=\"wysiwyg-text-align-center\"><img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/34318994782619\" alt=\"Countdown timer settings\" width=\"499\" height=\"431\"></p>\n<h3 id=\"h_01JMW5W242FNK6FJ1MYT6XEZPS\">Variable date countdowns</h3>\n<p>Choose the number of days, hours, and minutes that should appear on the timer when the form initially loads, up to 100 days in the future. </p>\n<p class=\"wysiwyg-text-align-center\"><img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/34319023272347\" alt=\"Variable settings for countdown timer\" width=\"499\" height=\"500\"></p>",
    "user_segment_ids": []
  },
